  "scope": "Local archive and member bytes were checked against current source weights, embedded manifests and the completed pool504 stage. Remote sizes and owner-only permissions describe prior backup verification. The 360 archive is a retained lineage dependency of full480; no 360 weights are routed by this evaluation.",
